          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json",
            "size": 1296,
            "text": "{\"images\":[{\"url\":\"https://v3b.fal.media/files/b/0ab0577d/_f41c19dZH_IzaGcPr6kw.png\",\"content_type\":\"image/png\",\"file_name\":null,\"file_size\":null,\"width\":1024,\"height\":1024}],\"seed\":347119338,\"prompt\":\"A single red ceramic cup sits on a rustic wooden table. The cup is crafted with a smooth, glossy red glaze that catches soft, natural light. The table is made of wide wooden planks with visible grain, occasional knots, and a matte finish, extending across the entire frame. The cup is positioned slightly to the right of center, occupying about one-quarter of the frame space. The camera uses a 50mm lens held at chest height, creating a natural perspective with a shallow depth of field. In the background, a soft-focus kitchen is visible with a white-tiled wall and a dark wooden shelf, providing a domestic context without distracting. Bright morning light streams from a large window on the left, creating a sharp highlight on the rim of the cup as natural light hits the curved side of the cup. A soft shadow is cast beneath the cup and extends across the wood grain to the right. The table's surface shows fine textures and slight wear, and the cup rests on the wooden surface.\",\"timings\":{\"prompt_expansion\":1.4195824300404638,\"inference\":3.5318318529753014},\"has_nsfw_concepts\":[false]}"
